WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:02.352
YELENA BELOVA
Why do you always do that thing?

00:00:02.403 --> 00:00:03.545
NATASHA ROMANOFF
What thing?

00:00:03.750 --> 00:00:05.129
YELENA BELOVA
This thing that you do

00:00:05.180 --> 00:00:06.465
when you whip your hair.

00:00:06.922 --> 00:00:07.969
'Cause you're a total poser.

00:00:08.020 --> 00:00:08.719
NATASHA ROMANOFF
I'm not a poser.

00:00:08.770 --> 00:00:09.719
[Laughing]

00:00:11.016 --> 00:00:12.012
NATASHA ROMANOFF
Did you miss me?

00:00:14.800 --> 00:00:15.516
YELENA BELOVA
Woo!

00:00:16.745 --> 00:00:17.339
ALEXEI SHOSTAKOV
What?

00:00:17.390 --> 00:00:18.310
NATASHA ROMANOFF
Just don't make a scene.

00:00:19.964 --> 00:00:21.605
You made a scene, didn't you.

00:00:22.132 --> 00:00:23.065
ALEXEI SHOSTAKOV
Let's go!

